msgid "Definitions of measures and dimensions for each domain, kept in version control."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-semantics.md
msgid "[The semantic layer]{1} explains how one definition is served to every consumer, and the rules for the portable subset."
msgstr ""

